stateDiagram-v2
accTitle: Mobile credentials have a bounded lifetime
accDescr: A trusted backend authenticates and authorizes the user before issuing a scoped session. Expired sessions cannot continue to access S3.
[*] --> Unauthenticated
Unauthenticated --> Authorizing: Sign in to backend
Authorizing --> ActiveSession: Identity and prefix approved
Authorizing --> Unauthenticated: Authentication or access denied
note right of ActiveSession: Direct S3 requests within scope
ActiveSession --> Authorizing: Request a new session before expiry
ActiveSession --> Expired: Credential expiration reached
Expired --> Authorizing: Revalidate identity and access
note right of Expired: S3 rejects expired credentials
